s autonomous loop.\n- Recurring pattern across waves: stage-into-Foundry (copy) + `map.json` entry + invariant extension; outward delivery and source deletion are always manual.\n\n---\n\nNote: per the git log, Waves 4 and 5 are already committed GREEN (`foreman: wave 5 â€¦ GREEN (gate 20/20)`), so this plan is largely executed. Want me to cross-check the current invariant suite against these five waves to confirm what's actually landed versus still pending FINALIZE?"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":638,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1930,"cache_read_input_tokens":29975,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1930},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aa9c28e0-5bf5-4e99-8632-92b2c51c9549","uuid":"e45e50e6-ac56-4a34-a12a-de087ee7767d","request_id":"req_011CcBpkJ7Za1tRRofrkEeay"}
